{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48911","headline":"宿寿安山阴馆闻泉 · 崔橹","name":"宿寿安山阴馆闻泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一支清急万山来，穿竹喧飞破石苔。\n梦在故乡临欲到，声闻孤枕却惊回。\n多愁鬓发余甘老，有限年光尔莫催。\n绿忆旧游相似处，月明山响子陵台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}